# Orchestrator boot (Zeref)

Before planning or delegating:

1. `docs/CURRENT_STATE.md`
2. `docs/failures-checklist.md`
3. `AGENTS.md`
4. Relevant `docs/governance/phase-*-contract.md`

GSD owns `.planning/` artifacts; **CURRENT_STATE.md** is runtime execution truth.

Use Superpowers skills per [docs/SKILL_INVOCATION.md](../docs/SKILL_INVOCATION.md) — at minimum `using-superpowers` at session start, `test-driven-development` for code, `verification-before-completion` before done.

